===Etymology 1===
{{rfe|lang=en}}

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# A [[wooden]] [[block]], the size of a [[brick]], built into a [[wall]], as a [[hold]] for the [[nail]]s of [[woodwork]].
# One of the [[square]] [[log]]s of [[wood]] used in a [[pile]] to [[support]] the [[roof]] of a [[mine]].
# {{lb|en|shipbuilding}} A [[treenail]] to [[fasten]] the [[shore]]s.

====Verb====
{{en-verb|nogg}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} to [[fill in]], as between [[scantling]], with [[brickwork]].
# {{lb|en|transitive|shipbuilding}} to fasten, as [[shores]], with [[treenails]].

===Etymology 2===

====Noun====
